  "note": [
    "The table illustrates the age in pending cases per court category with migration cases separated, as the number of pending cases older than 6 months, 12 months and 24 months. The same case may occur in several age groups. Pending cases are ongoing (open) cases at the end of the year.",
    "Matters in district courts are excluded, as are matters in rent and tenancy tribunals. The migration courts and the Migration Court of Appeal were established in 2006 as lower and higher instances in migration law cases."
